#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 15
#: rc.cpp:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, Konqueror will open a new window when you open a "
"folder, rather than showing that folder's contents in the current window."
msgstr ""
"Heke ev vebijêrk nîşankirî be, dema tu peldankekê bitikînî Konqueror naveroka "
"wê peldankê li şûna ku di paceyeke vekirî de nîşan bide, paceyeke nû vedike."

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 20
#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:124 rc.cpp:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Home Folder"
msgstr "Peldanka Malê"

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 21
#: rc.cpp:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the URL (e.g. a folder or a web page) where Konqueror will jump to when "
"the \\\"Home\\\" button is pressed. This is usually your home folder, "
"symbolized by a 'tilde' (~)."
msgstr ""
"Dema te pê li bişkojka \\\"Home\\\" kir URL ya peldank an jî rûpela webê ye ku "
"dê Konqueror tê de bi cih bibe. Peldanka home (mal) bi piranî bi nîşana 'tilt' "
"(~) tê nîşankirin."

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 26
#: rc.cpp:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show file tips"
msgstr "Liberxistinên pelan nîşan bide"

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 27
#: rc.cpp:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can control if, when moving the mouse over a file, you want to see a "
"small popup window with additional information about that file"
msgstr ""
"Li vir mirov dikare taybetiya dema mişk çû ser pelekê, ku der barê pel de "
"agahiyên berfireh dide dikare were çalakirin."

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 38
#: rc.cpp:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show previews in file tips"
msgstr "Di hûrbîniya pelan de pêşdîtinê nîşan bide"

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 39
#: rc.cpp:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can control if you want the popup window to contain a larger preview "
"for the file, when moving the mouse over it"
msgstr ""
"Li vir taybetiya ku dema mişk di ser pelekê re derbas dibe, vebûn an jî "
"venebûna paceyekê ku pêşdîtina pel nîşan bide dikare were belîkirin."

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 44
#: rc.cpp:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rename icons inline"
msgstr "Dawêran inline ji nû ve bi nav bike"

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 45
#: rc.cpp:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Checking this option will allow files to be renamed by clicking directly on the "
"icon name."
msgstr ""
"Bi nîşankirina vê vebijêrkê re, dê destûr were dayin ku êdî bi tikandina dawêrê "
"re navê pelan were guhartin."

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 50
#: rc.cpp:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show 'Delete' menu entries which bypass the trashcan"
msgstr "Di pêşeka 'Jê bibe' de zikê gavkirina Qutiya Gilêşê nîşan bide"

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 51
#: rc.cpp:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Uncheck this if you do not want 'Delete' menu commands to be displayed on the "
"desktop and in the file manager's menus and context menus. You can still delete "
"files when hidden by holding the Shift key while calling 'Move to Trash'."
msgstr ""
"Heke tu dixwazî fermanên 'Jê Bibe' li Sermaseyê, di rêveberiya pelgehan de û di "
"pêşekên şertan de tune be, nîşana vê derê rake. Tu dikarî pê lu bişkojka Shift "
"bikî û pelgehan jê bibî. (Tê wateya avêtina hundirê Qutiya Gilêşê)"

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 57
#: rc.cpp:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard font"
msgstr "Curenivîsa standard"

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 58
#: rc.cpp:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is the font used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr "Curenivîsa ku di paceyên Konqueror'ê de nivîs bi kar tînin."

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 598
#: rc.cpp:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ask confirmation for deleting a file."
msgstr "Di jêbirina pelan de erêkirinê bixwaze."

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 604
#: rc.cpp:287
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ask confirmation for move to trash"
msgstr "Di avêtina Qutiya Gilêşê de erêkirinê bixwaze"

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 605
#: rc.cpp:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you move the "
"file to your trash folder, from where it can be recovered very easily."
msgstr ""
"Ev vebijêrk bi Konqueror'ê dide zanîn dema pelek avêtin qutiya gilêşê (dûre bi "
"hêsanî dikare were vegerandin) pêşî erêkirinê bixwaze an nexwaze."

#. i18n: file konqueror.kcfg line 615
#: rc.cpp:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you simply "
"delete the file."
msgstr ""
"Ev vebijêrk bi Konqueror dide zanîn ku di dema jêbirina pelekê de bila "
"erêkirinê bixwaze an nexwaze."

